{"method": "asr-anchored (whisper windows) + syllables", "duration": 101.264, "speech_start": 0.0, "speech_end": 101.18, "silence_threshold_db": -35.2, "pauses": [{"start": 2.01, "end": 2.24}, {"start": 4.81, "end": 5.21}, {"start": 7.22, "end": 7.69}, {"start": 12.56, "end": 12.81}, {"start": 15.13, "end": 15.43}, {"start": 16.66, "end": 16.78}, {"start": 17.54, "end": 17.76}, {"start": 19.53, "end": 19.69}, {"start": 20.64, "end": 20.82}, {"start": 22.68, "end": 23.08}, {"start": 25.01, "end": 25.38}, {"start": 27.77, "end": 27.94}, {"start": 29.06, "end": 29.25}, {"start": 30.26, "end": 30.62}, {"start": 31.94, "end": 32.24}, {"start": 34.18, "end": 34.32}, {"start": 36.8, "end": 37.2}, {"start": 38.69, "end": 38.85}, {"start": 41.41, "end": 41.53}, {"start": 43.66, "end": 43.81}, {"start": 46.92, "end": 47.04}, {"start": 48.51, "end": 48.82}, {"start": 51.56, "end": 51.71}, {"start": 54.51, "end": 54.63}, {"start": 55.83, "end": 56.19}, {"start": 57.68, "end": 57.91}, {"start": 59.28, "end": 59.49}, {"start": 62.52, "end": 62.67}, {"start": 63.76, "end": 63.98}, {"start": 67.62, "end": 67.75}, {"start": 68.68, "end": 69.0}, {"start": 71.12, "end": 71.29}, {"start": 72.15, "end": 72.29}, {"start": 73.23, "end": 73.39}, {"start": 74.17, "end": 74.39}, {"start": 74.84, "end": 75.0}, {"start": 75.66, "end": 75.82}, {"start": 78.86, "end": 79.11}, {"start": 80.62, "end": 80.78}, {"start": 87.18, "end": 87.35}, {"start": 88.05, "end": 88.19}, {"start": 88.84, "end": 88.99}, {"start": 90.47, "end": 90.62}, {"start": 94.91, "end": 95.05}, {"start": 96.64, "end": 96.81}], "segments": [{"i": 0, "text": "Imagine passar em frente a um cemit\u00e9rio e descobrir que est\u00e3o realizando o seu pr\u00f3prio funeral.", "start": 0, "end": 4.927, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 1, "text": "Foi exatamente isso que aconteceu com Marcelo,", "start": 4.927, "end": 7.412, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 2, "text": "um homem de 34 anos que voltava do trabalho quando viu uma multid\u00e3o reunida diante de um t\u00famulo.", "start": 7.412, "end": 12.599, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 3, "text": "Curioso,", "start": 12.599, "end": 13.016, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 4, "text": "aproximou-se para entender o que estava acontecendo.", "start": 13.016, "end": 15.546, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 5, "text": "Mas,", "start": 15.546, "end": 15.667, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 6, "text": "quando olhou para a fotografia sobre o caix\u00e3o,", "start": 15.667, "end": 18.156, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 7, "text": "sentiu as pernas perderem a for\u00e7a.", "start": 18.156, "end": 19.5, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 8, "text": "Era o rosto dele.", "start": 19.5, "end": 20.738, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 9, "text": "Marcelo come\u00e7ou a rir nervosamente,", "start": 20.738, "end": 22.457, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 10, "text": "achando que aquilo era uma brincadeira de mau gosto.", "start": 22.457, "end": 25.236, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 11, "text": "At\u00e9 ouvir uma mulher chorando e repetindo seu nome.", "start": 25.236, "end": 27.886, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 12, "text": "Era sua pr\u00f3pria esposa.", "start": 27.886, "end": 29.005, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 13, "text": "Ele tentou cham\u00e1-la,", "start": 29.005, "end": 30.043, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 14, "text": "mas,", "start": 30.043, "end": 30.182, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 15, "text": "quando ela olhou em sua dire\u00e7\u00e3o,", "start": 30.182, "end": 32.1, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 16, "text": "ficou completamente branca e desmaiou.", "start": 32.1, "end": 33.904, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 17, "text": "Um homem de terno percebeu sua presen\u00e7a e correu at\u00e9 ele.", "start": 33.904, "end": 37.039, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 18, "text": "Segurou seu bra\u00e7o e sussurrou:", "start": 37.039, "end": 38.447, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 19, "text": "\"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria estar aqui.", "start": 38.447, "end": 40.145, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 20, "text": "N\u00f3s enterramos voc\u00ea ontem.\"", "start": 40.145, "end": 41.401, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 21, "text": "Marcelo se soltou e exigiu explica\u00e7\u00f5es.", "start": 41.401, "end": 43.487, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 22, "text": "O desconhecido abriu uma pasta e mostrou uma certid\u00e3o de \u00f3bito,", "start": 43.487, "end": 47.036, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 23, "text": "documentos de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 o resultado de um exame que confirmava sua morte.", "start": 47.036, "end": 51.518, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 24, "text": "Tudo estava registrado oficialmente.", "start": 51.518, "end": 53.779, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 25, "text": "Desesperado,", "start": 53.779, "end": 54.457, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 26, "text": "Marcelo ligou para a esposa,", "start": 54.457, "end": 56.15, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 27, "text": "mas o celular dela estava desligado.", "start": 56.15, "end": 58.036, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 28, "text": "Ent\u00e3o percebeu outro detalhe:", "start": 58.036, "end": 59.464, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 29, "text": "ningu\u00e9m naquele funeral parecia surpreso com sua apar\u00eancia.", "start": 59.464, "end": 62.567, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 30, "text": "Todos estavam assustados,", "start": 62.567, "end": 63.83, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 31, "text": "como se estivessem vendo um morto voltar \u00e0 vida.", "start": 63.83, "end": 66.166, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 32, "text": "Ele decidiu procurar a pol\u00edcia,", "start": 66.166, "end": 67.779, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 33, "text": "mas,", "start": 67.779, "end": 68.043, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 34, "text": "antes de sair,", "start": 68.043, "end": 68.599, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 35, "text": "encontrou uma fotografia ca\u00edda perto do caix\u00e3o.", "start": 68.599, "end": 70.986, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 36, "text": "Era uma imagem dele entrando em um carro,", "start": 70.986, "end": 73.324, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 37, "text": "poucos dias antes.", "start": 73.324, "end": 74.162, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 38, "text": "No verso havia uma frase:", "start": 74.162, "end": 75.671, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 39, "text": "\"Agora ningu\u00e9m vai procurar pelo verdadeiro desaparecido.\"", "start": 75.671, "end": 78.984, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 40, "text": "Naquele instante,", "start": 78.984, "end": 79.904, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 41, "text": "Marcelo entendeu.", "start": 79.904, "end": 80.738, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 42, "text": "Algu\u00e9m havia preparado sua morte para assumir sua identidade e ficar com tudo o que possu\u00eda.", "start": 80.738, "end": 85.259, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 43, "text": "Mas a \u00faltima descoberta foi ainda pior:", "start": 85.259, "end": 87.066, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 44, "text": "o homem de terno era seu irm\u00e3o,", "start": 87.066, "end": 88.657, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 45, "text": "desaparecido havia quinze anos.", "start": 88.657, "end": 90.398, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 46, "text": "E,", "start": 90.398, "end": 90.522, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 47, "text": "quando Marcelo levantou os olhos para procur\u00e1-lo,", "start": 90.522, "end": 92.752, "anchored_on_pause": false}, {"i": 48, "text": "ele j\u00e1 estava entrando no carro da sua esposa.", "start": 92.752, "end": 95.0, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 49, "text": "O funeral n\u00e3o era uma despedida.", "start": 95.0, "end": 97.177, "anchored_on_pause": true}, {"i": 50, "text": "Era a comemora\u00e7\u00e3o de quem finalmente conseguiu roubar sua vida.", "start": 97.177, "end": 101.264, "anchored_on_pause": null}], "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.05, "seg": 0}, {"w": "passar", "start": 0.019, "